# EXAMPLE ONLY — adapt to the actual Mosquitto version and deployment.
# Never commit real credentials. Configure password_file and TLS separately.
# Broker ACL baseline for ESP32-S3 client sentinel-esp32-SX-001:
user sentinel-esp32-SX-001
topic read sentinel/v1/devices/SX-001/cmd
topic write sentinel/v1/devices/SX-001/ack
topic write sentinel/v1/devices/SX-001/events
topic write sentinel/v1/devices/SX-001/status
topic write sentinel/v1/devices/SX-001/connectivity

# Edge service credentials must be separate and scoped to its required topics.
# Do not grant the ESP32 permission to publish to the /cmd topic.
